# NOTE: videos/ ships on purpose. The POTW intros must play on a school
# computer with no internet, so they cannot live on YouTube. ~108MB total —
# large for a repo, but a clone has to just work with nothing left to install.
# They were 271MB until 2026-08-03: encoded at ~10 Mbps, roughly three times
# what 1280x720/24 needs. Re-encoded at CRF 21 with the audio stream COPIED,
# not re-encoded (these are music-led intros played through classroom
# speakers). Same resolution, same duration, less than half the bytes.
# retired original house art only — new shields/icons/class assets MUST ship
images/camelot.png
images/atlantis.png
images/valhalla.png
images/rivendell.png
images/*-old*.png
